  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Communications and Knowledge Management Strategy for the Papua New Guinea NBSAP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Papua New Guinea, globally recognized for its biodiversity and endemism, has been engagedin a process of realigning its NBSAP Targets to the Global Biodiversity Framework. As part ofthis, representatives from several sectors are participating in a Technical Working Groupproviding their expertise. Although this work is proceeding as scheduled, there is a generalconcern amongst the TWG members: (i) limited knowledge and understanding of what theCBD is; (ii) why the need for NBSAP preparation; and</narrative>
  </description>
